  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bokk Doole Irrigated Horticulture Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Horticulture (irrigated).Beneficiaries: 324 (323 women).Description: The group seeks to expand its irrigation infrastructure and fence to increase the area under production from 3 to 7 hectares, and obtain adequate working capital for inputs, recruitment of a to expand the number of persons with access to plots and increase production quantity and quality.</narrative>
